# Generated data + results (derived, not version-controlled)
# NOTE: git's `dir/*.csv` matches only direct children, NOT subdirectories --
# that gap let 195 data files (~380 MB) into history on 2026-07-27. The `**`
# forms below cover the whole tree. The immutable OpenAQ snapshots are not
# tracked in git and are not yet published; any future release is gated on
# redistribution/licence review. pull_manifest.jsonl remains as provenance.
data/openaq/**/*.csv
data/openaq/_backup_pre_sensorfix/
data/openaq/archive/parts/
data/era5/*.nc
data/cams/*.nc
data/processed/*.csv
results/metrics/*
results/plots/*
data/cams_analysis/*.nc
data/cams_analysis/*.zip
data/cams_analysis/*.json
data/cams_analysis/*.log
data/cams_analysis/*.part
data/cams_forecast/
artifacts/gpu_inputs/
!**/.gitkeep
results/*.nc

# Resumable GFS forecast-BLH acquisition cache (assembled samples/provenance are tracked)
data/gfs_blh/by_init/

# ERA5 boundary-layer + SILAM incumbent capture (derived/bulk, NOT version-controlled).
# 348 MB of these was committed in e0a3487 by a `git add -A`; untracked in the
# follow-up commit. The blobs remain reachable in history -- folded into the
# existing clean-mirror / history-rewrite decision in PUBLICATION_READINESS.md.
data/era5_blh/*.nc
data/era5_blh/*.csv
data/silam/**/*.csv
data/silam/**/*.nc
